[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Open a File Safely
GenericName=Throw-away sandbox for files
Comment=Open a file you are not sure about in a sandbox that cannot see your files or the internet, and is deleted afterwards
Exec=/usr/local/bin/secure-linux-sandbox
Icon=security-high
Terminal=false
Categories=Utility;Security;
Keywords=sandbox;safe;suspicious;attachment;virus;open;
